{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18488","headline":"初发太原途中寄太原所思 · 欧阳詹","name":"初发太原途中寄太原所思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"驱马觉渐远，回头长路尘。\n高城已不见，况复城中人。\n去意自未甘，居情谅犹辛。\n五原东北晋，千里西南秦。\n一屦不出门，一车无停轮。\n流萍与系匏，早晚期相亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳詹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18488.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18488","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}